      "id": "claim_fd250a62ef4942e0860af5cc55bd17fd",
      "statement": "The query-response routing lane is a measured calibration observation, not a quality result: the authored query-judge calibration passed 22 of 24 fixtures, with the two acceptable-greeting fixtures chat-greeting-ok-1 and chat-greeting-ok-2 scoring 0.78 and 0.72 against the required 0.80 CHITCHAT_ACCEPTABLE_MIN minimum, so no paired or paid measurement of current+llm, deterministic+llm, or tool+llm was attempted.",
